 "source_instruction": "i need a machine wash, red tooloud italian flag the medium size",
 "query": "I spent all morning chasing my neighbor\u2019s escaped golden retriever around the community park, and I swear that dog has a sixth sense for avoiding leashes. He darted straight for the community garden, trampled half a row of baby tomato plants, and then plopped down in the middle of the splash pad like he\u2019d earned a cool-off. The garden\u2019s volunteer coordinator was laughing so hard she didn\u2019t even scold me, just handed me a handful of fresh sugar snap peas as a consolation prize by the time I finally got a hold of his collar. I\u2019m still a little out of breath and grass-stained, honestly, but I figured I\u2019d knock out a quick errand while I\u2019m already on my phone.\nHey there, I\u2019m looking through your men\u2019s shorts section right now. I need pairs that are dry clean only, come in medium, have built-in UPF 100 sun protection, and don\u2019t go over $40 total. I\u2019d also like them in a nice bright color, whatever you\u2019ve got that fits the rest of the specs works for me. I don\u2019t want anything super baggy or too tight, just a regular casual fit that holds up to regular wear.",
